<title>USA: Intermedia offering notes, preferred stock.</title>
<headline>Intermedia offering notes, preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermedia Communications Inc said Tuesday it will offer $300 million of senior discount notes and $100 million of convertible preferred stock in two private offerings.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the offerings to be resold by the initial purchasers.</p>
<p>Intermedia said the net proceeds from these offerings will be used to retire its outstanding 13-1/2 percent senior notes due 2005, to fund its business plan, and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Intermedia is a telecommunications company.</p>
</text>
